cannot kind of stress test me saying no to you, then actually there might well be the fact that We need to end those relationships, end those jobs, end those friendships so that you can be around people where you're allowed to have your own wants, needs and desires met and to know that that isn't selfish. You might have been told that you're selfish or too self-focused, but that might well have been because you weren't allowing that other person to have their needs met. But it doesn't mean that your needs were never valid in the first place. I would love your thoughts on this. Please do let me know in the comments and thank you for being here as a member of Inner Work. If there are any topics you'd like me to discuss in future, please don't hesitate to let me know.
